    "You always choose whether to use a gentler option or keep the planned workout." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Siempre eliges si utilizar una opción más suave o mantener el entrenamiento planificado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以随时选择更轻松的方案，也可以保留原定训练。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are building something steady." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estás construyendo algo sólido."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的节奏，正在慢慢成形。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also shake your iPhone twice when an activity isn’t recording." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "También puedes agitar tu iPhone dos veces cuando no se esté grabando una actividad."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未在记录活动时，你也可以摇晃 iPhone 两次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You completed this week’s rhythm." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已完成本周的跑步节奏目标。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Has completado el ritmo de esta semana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You completed today’s %@ activity. Let that work count and prioritize recovery now." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日的 %1$@ 活动已完成。让这份付出充分发挥作用，现在优先恢复吧。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Has completado la actividad de %@ de hoy. Da valor a ese esfuerzo y prioriza ahora la recuperación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You do not need a big day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hoy no tiene que ser un gran día."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天，不必完成什么大目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You do not need a perfect session." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No necesitas una sesión perfecta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不必追求完美。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You followed through. Let that win be enough for today." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cumpliste contigo. Por hoy, quédate con esa victoria."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "说到做到。今天有这一份收获，就够了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You kept the promise." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cumpliste tu palabra."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你没有辜负自己。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You need a beginning. Your companion can take it from there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solo necesitas empezar. Tu compañero te ayudará con el resto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你只管迈出第一步，跑步伙伴会陪你继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You need a real one. Something small still counts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Haz una sesión de verdad. Aunque sea pequeña, cuenta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "踏踏实实跑一次。哪怕很短，也算数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're going" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Te has apuntado"
